WEBVTT

00:23.410 --> 00:30.420
It's right before your eyes... Just a little more...

00:30.630 --> 00:35.470
Your dream is right there.

00:36.180 --> 00:41.390
Only a small hunch...

00:41.640 --> 00:45.480
...keeps your hopes up now.

00:45.730 --> 00:50.860
In this endless, dark maze,

00:50.980 --> 00:54.990
strength is realizing...

00:55.740 --> 00:57.780
...your own weakness.

00:57.780 --> 01:01.120
Taking in the shining wind,

01:01.120 --> 01:06.120
you can fly...

01:06.670 --> 01:08.880
...towards the vast sky.

01:11.960 --> 01:15.970
When even the deepest darkness turns into light...

01:16.050 --> 01:23.560
...I believe in that instant.

01:24.230 --> 01:27.810
I'll keep on believing...

02:09.480 --> 02:10.900
M-Maron is...

02:11.900 --> 02:13.900
...Kaitou Jeanne.

02:17.150 --> 02:21.620
Friendship Destroyed?! Final Battle at the Evil Castle of Ice

02:36.380 --> 02:39.010
<i>Will someone please let Miyako-chan join in?</i>

02:39.010 --> 02:39.720
<i>No!</i>

02:39.720 --> 02:41.590
<i>Miyako-chan hits people!</i>

02:41.590 --> 02:44.140
<i>She flipped my skirt!</i>

02:44.140 --> 02:47.350
<i>Hey! Miyako-chan, come over here!</i>

02:59.490 --> 03:02.120
<i>What?! Are you accusing me?</i>

03:02.120 --> 03:03.740
<i>You're the one you collected it!</i>

03:03.740 --> 03:05.200
<i>It is suspicious!</i>

03:06.830 --> 03:11.210
<i>Where's proof that Miyako stole the money?!</i>

03:14.340 --> 03:16.920
Maron was always so energetic and strong...

03:17.960 --> 03:23.970
I relied too much on Maron's kindness... That's why I never noticed it.

03:35.900 --> 03:39.440
Tears

03:39.490 --> 03:42.200
In reality, she was all by herself and lonely.

03:42.950 --> 03:44.620
<i>Wow, this looks great!</i>

03:44.620 --> 03:47.490
<i>Your story is like an upside-down rabbit.</i>

03:47.490 --> 03:48.700
<i>The ears hurt.</i>

03:53.000 --> 03:57.800
I have to stand strong! I have to protect Maron!

03:58.590 --> 04:02.220
Come to think of it, Kaitou Jeanne looks exactly like Maron!

04:02.220 --> 04:05.340
<i>Yeah, yeah! I thought so, too!</i>

04:05.760 --> 04:07.310
<i>No!</i>

04:07.310 --> 04:09.560
<i>There's no way Maron could be Jeanne!</i>

04:09.560 --> 04:12.770
<i>Fine! I'll prove it!</i>

04:12.770 --> 04:17.480
<i>I'm going to arrest Kaitou Jeanne and prove that she isn't Maron!</i>

04:22.240 --> 04:25.240
<i>I'm going to become a police officer and protect Maron!</i>

04:25.240 --> 04:28.660
<i>I'm going to uncover Kaitou Jeanne's identity!</i>

04:28.660 --> 04:31.200
<i>I'm definitely going to become a police officer!</i>

04:31.700 --> 04:34.290
<i>Kaitou Jeanne! You're under arrest!</i>

04:37.790 --> 04:38.500
<i>Maron!</i>

04:40.300 --> 04:44.880
<i>No way! It's not true! Tell me it's not true!</i>

04:46.680 --> 04:49.970
<i>Tell me it's not true!!!</i>

04:54.640 --> 04:56.350
It's not true...

04:58.310 --> 05:01.730
Maron didn't deceive me the entire time...

05:01.730 --> 05:03.490
- Yes, she did.

05:04.200 --> 05:05.780
Who's there?!

05:05.780 --> 05:07.070
Who are you?!

05:11.410 --> 05:13.450
I am your heart.

05:15.870 --> 05:17.670
What kind of stupid thing are you talking about?!

05:17.670 --> 05:19.420
You're the one that's stupid!

05:20.550 --> 05:22.090
Toudaiji Miyako...

05:23.130 --> 05:25.380
You don't know anything...

05:25.380 --> 05:28.260
You were deceived the entire time.

05:28.260 --> 05:31.220
Do you still not realize the reason?

05:31.220 --> 05:32.430
What are you talking about?!

05:33.060 --> 05:39.940
With Maron as a thief, isn't Miyako, the detective's daughter, the best possible friend?

05:42.400 --> 05:45.650
She would know about all the plans...

05:45.650 --> 05:50.660
"I'm Maron-chan. I'm just a poor girl that's been abandoned by my parents..."

05:50.660 --> 05:54.200
"I've been putting on smiles and acting helpless."

05:55.790 --> 06:00.330
You were taken advantage of! She knew you had a soft heart!

06:02.670 --> 06:05.840
You know that yourself, don't you?!

06:05.840 --> 06:07.630
You are a weakling!

06:07.630 --> 06:10.600
But, you don't want others to see your weakness...

06:10.600 --> 06:11.470
Stop!

06:12.220 --> 06:17.890
And then there's Maron, who is less fortunate than you but much stronger.

06:20.520 --> 06:23.570
Whatever you do, you can never beat Maron...

06:27.030 --> 06:30.700
However, there is one thing you can defeat her in...

06:30.700 --> 06:32.780
I said stop!

06:32.780 --> 06:35.080
You can beat Maron!

06:40.040 --> 06:42.420
Poor Maron...

06:42.420 --> 06:44.960
Yes, sympathy.

06:44.960 --> 06:47.720
That's why you wanted to become a police officer, didn't you?

06:50.510 --> 06:54.220
To protect poor Maron...

06:54.220 --> 06:56.970
For the weak you to beat the strong Maron...

06:56.970 --> 06:57.810
That's not true!

06:57.810 --> 07:03.060
In order to be friends with Maron, you have to be as strong as her...

07:04.900 --> 07:09.610
Just as Maron was deceiving you this whole time, so were you deceiving yourself.

07:09.610 --> 07:10.700
No...

07:10.700 --> 07:15.120
Poor Miyako... You even let Maron have Chiaki.

07:15.120 --> 07:16.290
That's wrong!

07:17.580 --> 07:20.620
See? You're running away from yourself again.

07:20.620 --> 07:23.540
If not, look at me.

07:25.920 --> 07:30.130
You must get back the weak and helpless Maron again!

07:32.300 --> 07:33.550
Maron...

07:33.550 --> 07:38.220
Yes, you have to get back Maron's heart from Jeanne.

07:39.020 --> 07:43.480
Maron's heart... Jeanne stole it...

07:43.480 --> 07:46.360
Kaitou Jeanne... Kill her!

07:47.320 --> 07:49.570
Kill Jeanne...

07:49.570 --> 07:52.490
Then, you will be able to regain Maron.

07:52.490 --> 07:57.160
You will be able to become a great police officer and protect Maron.

07:57.160 --> 07:59.250
Kill Jeanne...

07:59.950 --> 08:02.290
Yes, kill her.

08:02.290 --> 08:04.830
Kill Jeanne, and...

08:06.130 --> 08:08.500
...get Maron back.

08:08.500 --> 08:10.510
This time...

08:10.510 --> 08:13.130
...you're going to save Maron.

08:16.720 --> 08:19.600
Miyako! Miyako!

08:21.390 --> 08:24.900
I even got Miyako involved. This is all my fault...

08:25.940 --> 08:28.900
Don't blame yourself, Maron. The one to blame is...

08:28.900 --> 08:31.150
The Devil! Not Fin-chan!!!

08:32.360 --> 08:34.160
I understand how you feel, but...

08:34.160 --> 08:36.370
Shut up! Fin-chan...!

08:38.620 --> 08:40.330
You, Demon!

08:40.330 --> 08:41.330
Wait!

08:41.330 --> 08:42.460
Where's Miyako?

08:42.460 --> 08:44.460
<i>She is with Queen-sama.</i>

08:44.460 --> 08:49.420
If you want to save her, come to the Castle of Ice.

08:50.380 --> 08:51.880
Castle of Ice?

08:51.880 --> 08:54.130
Access, do you know anything?

08:54.840 --> 08:56.300
Hold on!

09:03.520 --> 09:04.520
There she is!

09:04.520 --> 09:05.770
Right there!

09:12.940 --> 09:14.360
I got it!

09:14.360 --> 09:15.070
Where?!

09:15.070 --> 09:16.410
Wait, Maron!

09:17.030 --> 09:22.410
This is a trap! To lure Maron...no, Jeanne!

09:22.410 --> 09:23.450
I know...

09:25.750 --> 09:27.040
It's no use trying to stop you...

09:27.040 --> 09:29.920
Of course! Let's go! This way!

09:48.600 --> 09:49.190
Run!

09:53.610 --> 09:54.820
They destroyed our way back.

09:54.820 --> 09:58.200
Who cares? We don't intend on going back anyway.

09:58.200 --> 10:00.030
You're right. Let's go.

10:02.740 --> 10:04.120
Miyako...!

10:04.120 --> 10:06.910
Thank goodness! You escaped!

10:08.870 --> 10:10.170
What's the matter, Miyako?!

10:10.170 --> 10:12.040
What's going on?!

10:14.630 --> 10:16.220
Give her back...

10:16.220 --> 10:18.720
Give back my Maron!

10:23.180 --> 10:25.640
Maron!!!

10:51.920 --> 10:55.090
Miyako... Why?

10:55.090 --> 10:59.380
Why?! You got some nerve even asking that!

10:59.380 --> 11:02.180
You've been deceiving me the whole time!

11:02.180 --> 11:03.260
That's...

11:05.640 --> 11:06.890
Calm down, Miyako!

11:11.730 --> 11:13.650
Miyako, hold strong!

11:13.650 --> 11:15.230
It's me, Maron!

11:15.230 --> 11:18.150
Shut up! I'm not going to be fooled any longer!

11:18.400 --> 11:21.110
Miyako, are you being possessed by a Demon?

11:21.110 --> 11:25.330
No, not completely. Half of it is Miyako-chan's heart!

11:25.330 --> 11:27.120
T-That can't be...!

11:27.620 --> 11:33.790
Kaitou Jeanne... I, Toudaiji Miyako, will finally bring you to justice!

11:33.790 --> 11:35.170
Stop, Miyako!

11:35.170 --> 11:37.670
I won't lose to you!

11:38.920 --> 11:41.590
Damn! God's barrier is weakening!

11:44.350 --> 11:45.970
Die, Jeanne!

12:06.490 --> 12:09.620
Miyako, please stop!

12:15.500 --> 12:16.500
Miyako...

12:16.500 --> 12:21.550
Ki... Ki... You...

12:22.880 --> 12:27.180
Kill you... Kill you!

12:27.180 --> 12:28.350
Miyako!

12:28.350 --> 12:30.140
Kill you!

12:31.810 --> 12:35.560
Kill you! Kill you!!!

12:38.110 --> 12:40.230
Snap out of it, Miyako!

12:40.820 --> 12:43.650
Shut up! Die!!!

12:45.110 --> 12:46.620
Miyako, stop!

12:51.540 --> 12:54.460
Maron! Miyako is being possessed!

12:54.460 --> 12:55.870
<i>Checkmate</i> her!

13:00.960 --> 13:02.300
Maron, hurry!

13:04.430 --> 13:06.090
I can't do it...

13:06.090 --> 13:08.390
If I <i>Checkmate</i> her...

13:14.690 --> 13:17.100
No! I can't do it!

13:17.100 --> 13:18.230
Maron...!

13:18.230 --> 13:19.320
Move!!!

13:21.400 --> 13:22.030
Damn!

13:22.030 --> 13:23.740
Chiaki, stay back!

13:23.740 --> 13:24.780
Maron?!

13:24.780 --> 13:28.240
I'm going to call back Miyako.

13:28.240 --> 13:29.370
Shut up!

13:33.910 --> 13:37.420
Please, Miyako! Don't listen to the Demon's voice!

13:37.420 --> 13:41.750
It's impossible, Maron! You can't hurt Miyako!

13:41.750 --> 13:44.210
You can't change her back to normal!

13:45.220 --> 13:46.050
Damn!

13:46.050 --> 13:48.140
Chiaki! Turn into Sinbad!

13:48.930 --> 13:54.850
No, there's no longer any need for me to turn into Sinbad. I'm me!

13:54.850 --> 13:56.440
Don't get in the way!

13:57.810 --> 13:58.980
Chiaki!

14:01.610 --> 14:02.820
Miyako...

14:05.650 --> 14:09.200
Why do you hate me so much?

14:09.200 --> 14:11.370
Inside, you must be laughing...

14:11.370 --> 14:13.620
...that I don't stand a chance against you.

14:14.750 --> 14:19.290
What are you talking about, Miyako?! We're best friends, aren't we?

14:20.580 --> 14:21.750
No, you're wrong!

14:22.630 --> 14:24.760
Jeanne is my enemy!

14:26.010 --> 14:28.550
How long are you going to keep that mask of friendship on?

14:28.550 --> 14:30.340
Why don't you become serious?!

14:30.340 --> 14:33.930
Or are you still showing me sympathy?

14:33.930 --> 14:35.270
Sympathy?

14:37.270 --> 14:39.310
You're going to die, Jeanne!

14:39.310 --> 14:42.820
Once you're dead, my Maron will return!

14:44.780 --> 14:47.400
Why are you siding with Jeanne?!

14:47.400 --> 14:49.860
Jeanne is just a thief!

14:49.860 --> 14:54.330
She stole my heart and Chiaki's kind heart, too!

14:54.330 --> 14:56.790
Miyako, try to remember!

14:56.790 --> 14:58.870
Jeanne isn't just a normal thief!

14:58.870 --> 15:03.540
What happened to everybody after Jeanne's heists?! Remember!

15:03.540 --> 15:06.050
Detective Toudaiji, your brother...

15:06.050 --> 15:08.340
They were all possessed by Demons!

15:13.350 --> 15:14.680
Demons...?

15:20.810 --> 15:23.810
Shut up! You're trying to trick me again!

15:23.810 --> 15:25.320
I'm going to protect Maron!

15:25.320 --> 15:27.820
Jeanne is the one that's possessing Maron!

15:27.820 --> 15:29.490
Just a little bit more, Chiaki!

15:29.490 --> 15:31.570
The Demon's powers are weakening!

15:46.380 --> 15:47.460
Fin-chan!

15:47.460 --> 15:48.260
Fin!

15:48.670 --> 15:50.880
Kill her, Miyako.

15:50.880 --> 15:55.850
If you kill Jeanne, Maron will change back into her poor self again.

15:55.850 --> 15:59.270
Don't you want to get back the weak Maron?

16:06.060 --> 16:11.570
Miyako, look at me! Jeanne is me! Maron, herself!

16:11.570 --> 16:15.950
The weak Maron, the strong Jeanne... They're both the same person!

16:16.990 --> 16:19.540
That's a lie! It has to be a lie!

16:19.540 --> 16:22.210
It's not a lie. Look at me.

16:24.370 --> 16:27.290
Jeanne is Maron herself?

16:27.290 --> 16:29.710
Are you going to be tricked again, Miyako?!

16:30.800 --> 16:35.340
Now, kill Jeanne and get back your Maron.

16:36.890 --> 16:39.970
Maron... Get her back...

16:41.680 --> 16:43.390
Maron, run!

16:43.390 --> 16:47.230
Get back Maron...

16:47.230 --> 16:49.650
Please, Miyako! Snap out of it!

16:50.150 --> 16:51.900
Maron...

16:51.900 --> 16:54.110
Maron, run! Run!!!

16:54.780 --> 16:55.700
Maron!!!

16:56.910 --> 16:58.160
Miyako...!

16:58.620 --> 17:00.990
Now, do it Miyako!

17:00.990 --> 17:01.870
Stop!!!

17:01.870 --> 17:02.660
Die!!!

17:06.750 --> 17:08.750
- That's right, Jeanne.

17:08.750 --> 17:12.130
If you decided to trust Miyako's heart,

17:12.130 --> 17:14.340
confront her without running away!

17:14.340 --> 17:15.260
Noin!

17:15.260 --> 17:18.510
Noin, why are you interfering?!

17:18.510 --> 17:21.430
Because I made a vow to Jeanne d'Arc!

17:21.430 --> 17:24.020
To protect this girl, no matter what!

17:24.020 --> 17:27.520
Miyako! Kill both Noin and Jeanne!

17:34.360 --> 17:39.700
Miyako, can you not trust your feelings that care about Maron?

17:40.780 --> 17:42.660
My...feelings...?

17:43.700 --> 17:48.330
Don't look away from yourself. Trust yourself.

17:49.210 --> 17:51.130
Just like Maron,

17:51.130 --> 17:54.130
who trusted Miyako with her life.

17:55.880 --> 17:56.930
I...

18:01.100 --> 18:02.560
Fool...!

18:04.310 --> 18:05.140
Look out!

18:10.480 --> 18:11.980
Noin...!

18:12.770 --> 18:19.240
I held myself together by fighting Jeanne for Maron.

18:19.240 --> 18:23.330
I couldn't be equal with Maron unless I was running after Jeanne!

18:23.330 --> 18:25.000
I was scared!

18:25.000 --> 18:29.250
I was scared of Maron finding out that I didn't have faith in myself.

18:30.380 --> 18:32.420
I didn't want you to hate me...

18:32.420 --> 18:36.050
That's why I purposely had Chiaki dump me, and...

18:36.050 --> 18:40.220
I've always loved you Miyako, even those parts of you.

18:40.220 --> 18:43.060
Maron! I'm sorry...

18:43.060 --> 18:45.220
Good job, Miyako.

18:45.220 --> 18:47.770
You were able to defeat the Demon within you!

18:49.190 --> 18:51.520
Playtime is over, Noin.

18:58.610 --> 18:59.320
Noin!

18:59.320 --> 19:02.870
Did you think you could beat me?

19:08.330 --> 19:13.340
When I pitted myself against Queen, I was prepared for death...

19:14.800 --> 19:21.720
Queen, I was taught by Jeanne d'Arc... No, by Kusakabe Maron...

19:23.430 --> 19:27.180
When I failed to save the life of Jeanne d'Arc,

19:27.180 --> 19:32.440
I despised my weakness, cursed God and sold my soul to the Devil.

19:32.440 --> 19:40.900
However, the weak person I was and the person that gained Demon powers, were both the same.

19:40.900 --> 19:48.080
Those two opposing actions were both for staying true to my love for Jeanne d'Arc!

19:49.370 --> 19:50.960
Hmph, you zombie...

19:50.960 --> 19:56.210
Don't be in such a rush, Queen. I'll die soon enough.

19:56.210 --> 19:57.920
Noin! What are you...?!

19:57.920 --> 19:59.630
Then die!

20:45.340 --> 20:46.510
Noin...!

20:50.680 --> 20:53.350
<i>This is how it should be. This...</i>

20:53.350 --> 20:59.400
<i>By meeting Kusakabe Maron, I was finally able to turn back into a normal man.</i>

20:59.400 --> 21:02.820
<i>I was able to defeat the weak person that sol</i>d his soul to the Devil...

21:02.820 --> 21:06.700
<i>...and stay true to my love for Jeanne d'Arc.</i>

21:06.700 --> 21:10.080
<i>I was able to regain the strong me.</i>

21:10.080 --> 21:13.290
Regain...yourself...

21:13.290 --> 21:16.210
<i>Humans are incomplete creatures.</i>

21:16.210 --> 21:19.460
<i>Both strength and weakness live within one heart.</i>

21:19.460 --> 21:22.800
<i>Good and bad, white and black...</i>

21:22.800 --> 21:27.300
<i>But, you can overcome that by believing in yourself...</i>

21:27.300 --> 21:29.390
<i>...just as Miyako saved herself.</i>

21:29.390 --> 21:32.310
<i>Maron! Don't forget that!</i>

21:32.310 --> 21:35.890
And also, please save Fin!

21:40.520 --> 21:43.860
<i>Noin, now you can finally...</i>

21:43.860 --> 21:46.360
<i>...return to Jeanne d'Arc.</i>

21:46.360 --> 21:50.910
Like the man who fell in love with Jeanne d'Arc...

21:52.370 --> 21:55.410
...I'm going to continue to protect you, Maron!

21:55.410 --> 21:57.750
Including the part that Noin couldn't fulfill!

21:57.750 --> 21:59.130
Chiaki...

21:59.130 --> 22:02.670
Maron, let me help you too.

22:02.670 --> 22:06.630
Being a thief is my job. It's not for a police officer.

22:09.430 --> 22:12.600
I understand! I'll trust you and stay here!

22:12.600 --> 22:14.270
Please come back!

22:15.310 --> 22:16.890
This will be the final...

22:18.100 --> 22:19.860
...big heist!

22:28.610 --> 22:35.250
The thick clouds past and the descending light...

22:36.000 --> 22:44.630
...slowly melts the hardened, damaged past.

22:45.260 --> 22:49.130
Because we live so stiffly,

22:49.130 --> 22:52.800
it's so easy to smash into pieces.

22:53.050 --> 23:01.980
And I never thought that I had anything to protect...

23:02.520 --> 23:05.690
Never forgetting...

23:05.980 --> 23:09.820
...there is unending love.

23:10.530 --> 23:14.580
I'll catch it, I'll steal it.

23:14.740 --> 23:17.870
Then embrace you with it.

23:18.160 --> 23:21.080
Even if there comes a time...

23:21.580 --> 23:26.050
...when this planet is destroyed,

23:26.250 --> 23:30.130
I won't be lonely, I won't be alone.

23:30.340 --> 23:37.890
I'll be embracing an eternal wind.

23:48.280 --> 23:52.110
God's breath becomes the wind and breezes through all things.

23:52.110 --> 23:55.910
That wind is gentle, fierce and sometimes becomes wild.

23:55.910 --> 23:57.870
But it will never disappear.

23:57.870 --> 24:02.620
It watches the sea, the sky, and it is in harmony with the forests and mountains.

24:02.620 --> 24:04.670
Is the wish either healing or commanding?

24:04.670 --> 24:08.090
When the time comes, that is when its true form will arise.

24:08.090 --> 24:13.430
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne, Final Episode: You, Become God's Wind!
